# PPSSPP master 83e616eaf97bd493f91944e5eced70d914b4bc18 (2026-10-28), on top of tools/ppsspp_master_vfpu_rn.diff: PPSSPP_FPU_FS=1 runs the FPU's
# add / sub / mul / div / sqrt / compares as the PSP-3000 under FCR31 FS (denormal results flushed, denormal inputs used exactly, x +- 0 = x
# for a denormal x, 0 - x = -x; probe 11, speed_notes §25), as tools/ppsspp_mgs2.diff does for 1.20.4. Master runs FS as FTZ + DAZ, which
# made the harness's VFPU group fallback count (vfb) 50 higher from vb 15,794 on (2026-10-29). Dev tool only, never shipped.
# Run: PPSSPP_VFPU_RN=1 PPSSPP_FPU_FS=1 PPSSPPHeadless <game>/EBOOT.PBP --memstick=<dir> --graphics=software (tools/dev/ppsspp_master_run.sh).
